OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FEvening
OL,6,Fshowers will retreat to the coasts to
OL,7,Fleave inland areas dry with clear
OL,8,Fspells overnight. The night will
OL,9,Fbecome frosty with a few fog patches.
OL,10,
OL,11,CWednesday:FDry, bright at first but
OL,12,Fblustery, locally heavy and wintry
OL,13,Fshowers spread southeast from late
OL,14,Fmorning. These showers become less
OL,15,Ffrequent from late afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
